  "system": {
    "slug": "ymir-mech",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 7
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>YMIR Mechs are hulking anti-infantry combat robots deployed by Cerberus and security forces where maximum stopping power is required. Armed with a rocket launcher and integrated minigun, a single YMIR Mech can pin down an entire squad. They are slow but extremely durable.</p><p><strong>Construct Immunities:</strong> Immune to disease, mental effects, poison, sleep, and paralysis.</p><p><strong>Rocket Salvo (2 actions):</strong> The YMIR fires a rocket at a point within 120 feet. Each creature within 20 feet of the impact point takes 4d10 fire damage (DC 24 Reflex for half). Recharge 1d3 rounds.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
